{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"那点亲切像一次说不明白的重逢，他想多待一会儿，心里竟生出一点感激。\",\n          \"key\": \"仿佛重逢\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"可这份好让他疑心：它是不是只属于回不去的从前？他急得反复追问，整个人却一阵阵往后缩。\",\n          \"key\": \"怕从前回不去\",\n          \"follows\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"唤起\",\n          \"why\": \"上一段那点亲切已经使他心软，愿意再贴近片刻；这次它仿佛更真切地来到身边，让他生出短暂相逢般的欢喜和感激。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 2,\n          \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"改写\",\n          \"why\": \"此前他怕的是那点熟悉从心里淡去；这次亲近得像重逢，他开始担心，自己所追寻的或许是某种已经无法重新拥有的东西，急切便转成了追问和退缩。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"还说不清\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"那点熟悉曾让他感到短暂而真切的幸福。\",\n        \"他开始怀疑，这份亲切也许来自无法重返的从前。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"短暂的亲密、随后的急切追问与退缩能够连成一条心理变化；但关于从前无法重返的担忧仍是试探性的猜想。\",\n      \"uses\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"他试着凭这阵亲切再往前走一步，心里竟轻快起来：也许这次真能站稳。\",\n          \"key\": \"借亲切站稳\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"可最初的疑问又回来：这股劲是不是还在硬撑？他脑中盘问不停，想向前却紧得直想退。\",\n          \"key\": \"又怕自己硬撑\",\n          \"follows\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"唤起\",\n          \"why\": \"上一段他已经尝到那点熟悉带来的亲切，虽然模糊，却确实使他心软；此刻他试着借这份温暖往前走，因而有了不同于最初强撑自己的轻快。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 2,\n          \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"唤起\",\n          \"why\": \"最初他被熟悉感推动、想向前试一步时，就担心自己的镇定只是勉强撑出来的；如今他再次感到有力，那个旧疑问便重新出现，使他急着确认自己究竟站不站得稳。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"没在想\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"那点亲切曾使他短暂觉得自己能够站稳。\",\n        \"最初对硬撑的怀疑重新出现，他开始反复盘问自己的力量是否真实。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"这条解释由最初明确存在的硬撑疑虑引出新的自我怀疑，既能说明柔软中的振作，也能说明随后急促的自问、紧绷和退缩。\",\n      \"uses\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8275086f-aff0-478f-a813-fcb90efcc0ee", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T153722798746Z", "elapsed_seconds": 390.172, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T15:43:52.982805+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cdbb2c89128716bc2dc190049d3cbc4ecc08b44aa19455ec7ec3426a25786d3f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T153722798746Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "217e6c31de81ced446e22c2b28cf58e5bd98f90da58e82c6db0a007d815d80c1"}}}
